<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle roundup - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said trade was quiet late Tuesday. There were no sales of slaughter steers or heifers at the close.</p>
<p>Inquiry was moderate, demand was light. Sales confirmed for the week to date on 3,600 cattle, mostly previously contracted or formulated cattle.</p>
<p>Confirmed: none     week ago: 1000   year ago: 3600</p>
<p>week to date: 3600  week ago: 6700   year ago: 12300</p>
